# Two per-draw trims from the 0113 sub-phase profile (27 Nov, qos_218, ~7,000 draws a frame): the pipeline layout was
# looked up in a std::map every draw (~0.35 ms a frame): the last draw's layout is kept and reused when the texture
# and sampler counts match. And a hot vertex page (0112) read by two of a draw's vertex streams was hashed twice:
# a page already checked or copied for the same draw (Renderer::draw_serial) isn't hashed again. The hot-pages
# profile line counts those ("already checked for the same draw").
